iv. Calculation of t-value.

v. Critical region:

For case (a)

Reject H_0 if t\le -t_{\alpha/2,(\nu)} or t\ge t_{\alpha/2,(\nu)}

For case (b)

Reject H_0 if t\ge t_{\alpha(\nu)}

For case (c)

Reject H_0 if t\le -t_{\alpha(\nu)}

Where t is computed value of t-statistic and t_{\alpha/2(\nu)} or t_{\alpha(\nu)} is table value.

